1
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:05,900
Oh no, dirty hands!

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,360
Mud on my paws
and mud on my wings,

3
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:15,000
let's wash it all off,
wash everything!

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,300
Wash, wash, wash your hands,

5
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,600
bubbles, bubbles everywhere!

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,980
Rub-a-dub, rub-a-dub-dub!
One, two…

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,080
Front and back and in between,

8
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:29,700
make them shiny,
make them clean!

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,200
Count to twenty, sing along,

10
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:39,800
wash away the germs so strong!

11
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,280
Wash, wash, wash your hands,

12
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:44,440
bubbles, bubbles everywhere!

13
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:47,980
Rub-a-dub, rub-a-dub,
one, two…

14
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,450
Dry them, dry them,
soft and warm.

15
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:54,900
Now we're ready,
safe from harm!

16
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,600
Clean hands, happy me!

17
00:01:00,700 --> 00:01:02,400
Bye-bye!
